      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 336,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790935953342,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Audit report + frozen split manifest\n2. LightGBM baseline and evaluation\n3. FT-Transformer and novelty ablations\n4. Calibration / fusion / explanations\n5. Replay -> alert JSON -> dashboard\n6. Drift replay + governed update demo",
      "originalText": "1. Audit report + frozen split manifest\n2. LightGBM baseline and evaluation\n3. FT-Transformer and novelty ablations\n4. Calibration / fusion / explanations\n5. Replay -> alert JSON -> dashboard\n6. Drift replay + governed update demo",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ffa0ea6c56274430aa17",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -850,
      "y": 2420,
      "width": 472.14,
      "height": 67.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 237,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 337,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790935953342,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Start with local replay and simple storage.\nQueues, replicas and live ingestion can\nbe introduced after the core demo works.",
      "originalText": "Start with local replay and simple storage.\nQueues, replicas and live ingestion can\nbe introduced after the core demo works.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 3,
